# API services (ubuteco-react)

All HTTP to Rails goes through `apiFetch` — see [frontend-map.md](../../docs/context/frontend-map.md).

## Rules

- Use `apiFetch` / domain services — no raw `fetch` to API.
- Base URL: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` (include in build CI).
- Errors: structured `{ errors: [{ code, field?, message }] }` — use `resolveApiErrorMessages`.
- Check companion API plan + OpenAPI before new endpoints.
- Cross-stack changes: link API PR; add MSW handler + test.

